  "item_short_desc": "<p>Crafted for everyday style and endless comfort, elevate your athletic wear with our Womens Essential Leggings. These comfortable leggings are designed with a high waisted full coverage elastic waistband that helps with tummy control and support. Featuring mobility enhancement gussets, the buttery-soft yoga pants allow you to move freely, ensuring you get the most out of your workout.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
